## 6. Content notice

Polluted text and image items in QIMG-7 contain deliberately false
factual statements, including statements about real named people and
organizations. These are synthetic benchmark artifacts generated for
robustness evaluation and are not assertions of fact by the authors.

They are not intended to be extracted, republished, indexed, or used as
training or reference data representing factual content. To reduce the
risk of misrepresentation, downstream users are strongly encouraged to
retain this notice and to clearly identify all polluted fields and
derivatives as synthetic or manipulated benchmark content.

This content notice is a responsible-use request and does not modify the
